474
00:22:31,284 --> 00:22:34,622
Not sure how your relationship is with
him since he fired Vince off <i>Aquaman</i>.

475
00:22:34,742 --> 00:22:36,043
<i>But you can call.</i>

476
00:22:36,163 --> 00:22:38,135
<i>In the meantime
call your writers and tell them</i>

477
00:22:38,295 --> 00:22:41,012
they have Edward Norton
and a $2 million offer.

478
00:22:41,364 --> 00:22:43,234
I'm sure they'll want to close.

479
00:22:48,289 --> 00:22:49,730
What did she say?

